# Who GitHub asks to review a pull request.
#
# Every pull request needs one approval before it can be merged (see
# docs/DEPLOYMENT.md, "Protect main"). This file makes GitHub ask for that
# review automatically, so nobody has to remember to.
#
# It names a team rather than people on purpose. People change every year; the
# team stays, and handing over means changing who is in it — on GitHub, under
# the organisation's Teams tab — not editing this file. See docs/HANDOVER.md.
#
# If the team is renamed or deleted, review requests silently stop. GitHub shows
# an error at the top of this file when that happens.

* @cambridge-indian-classical-music/committee
